  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Critical Care Compass was created by a nurse with other health care professionals in mind. We offer resources, tips, and support to empower nurses on their journey!<br>&bull; Product description: Visual bedside reference book for nurses working in the NICU. This guide will provide you with ALL the must-know information related to NICU nursing from cardiac defects, respiratory therapy, operating common devices (incubators, HFOV, neopuff, etc.), admissions, deliveries, to discharging your patients! Our book was written by a NICU nurse, and reviewed by a board certified neonatal nurse practitioner to help ensure accuracy, reliability, and helpfulness.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): Helpful information to quickly reference. Especially useful for NEW nurses who would like to learn more.&nbsp;<br>&bull; Payment terms: 20% Comission<br>&bull; Other information: Contains a pocket to store papers. Also contains chapter tabs to quickly flip to information. This is a printed 7 x 9.3 inch spiral bound book with 90+ pages. Contains numerous charts, illustrations, and tables for easy and fun learning.</p>\r\n</div>",
